<title>UK: Smith &amp; Nephew year pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Smith &amp; Nephew year pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.92		  vs 10.29</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.71		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.00		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Pretax		     178.7		  vs 176.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,069		  vs 1,026</p>
<p>NOTE - Above results after exceptional items. Pretax profit before exceptional items was 182.2 million stg versus 180.4 million stg in 1995.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits of 182.0 to 185.0 million stg for Smith &amp; Nephew Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
